  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This activity Printing and delivery of Baseline Students and Teacher Books to government secondary schools in Tanzania  is a component of Education Quality Improvement Programme &#x2013; Tanzania (EQUIP-T)  reported by FCDO with a funding type of 104 - Procurement of Services and a budget of &#xa3;751,793. It works in the following sector(s): Upper Secondary Education (modified and includes data from 11322), Teacher training, Education policy and administrative management.</narrative>
